{'symbol': 'IRM', 'date': '2022-01-26 07:00:00', 'title': 'IRON MOUNTAIN CLOSES ACQUISITION OF ITRENEW', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IRON MOUNTAIN INCORPORATED (NYSE: IRM), THE LEADING INFORMATION MANAGEMENT COMPANY, HAS COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF ITRENEW, A GLOBAL LEADER IN MISSION CRITICAL DATA CENTER LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS. WITH THE TRANSACTION, IRON MOUNTAIN ACQUIRED 80 PERCENT OF THE OUTSTANDING SHARES OF ITRENEW ON A CASH- AND DEBT-FREE BASIS FOR APPROXIMATELY $725 MILLION IN CASH, WITH THE REMAINING 20 PERCENT ACQUIRED WITHIN THREE YEARS OF CLOSE FOR A MINIMUM ENTERPRISE VALUE OF $92'}